   "id": 5573,
   "hub_id": 8244,
   "version": "0.4.0",
   "description": "<p>This update REQUIRE A NEW SPT 3.7.x INSTALLATION TO BE USED WITHOUT KNOWN BUGS IF YOU ALREADY INSTALLED THIS MOD</p>\n<p>THIS UPDATE HAS A LOT OF CODE OPTIMIZATION AND BUG FIX ! WE USE ONLY MODS FOLDER (WE DON’T USE AKI_DATA ANYMORE)</p>\n<p>Anastasia</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add new Quests with USEC interaction</li>\n<li>Update Locales Translation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Evelyn</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Welcome to the new USEC Trader. She’ll provide QUESTS for USEC only. And for BEAR soon™</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Svetlana</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Svetlana only provide QUESTS for BEAR. And for USEC soon™</li>\n<li>The Quest “PROMOTION: LIEUTENANT” is now unlocked properly after “PROMOTION: JUNIOR LIEUTENANT”</li>\n<li>Update Locales Translation</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Virtual’s Custom Quest Loader</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Update new mod version from 1.4.0 to 1.4.2</li>\n<li>All pictures now moved to this mod</li>\n<li>Fixed Chinese translation not appayring correctly</li>\n<li>Upgraded all translation files to be more versatile when adding a new one</li>\n</ul>\n",
